"""
Native Dispatch Kind Constants

Single source of truth for every NATIVE_KIND_* integer identifier used by
the dispatch switch, the VM, the global bootstrap, and individual builtin
modules (streams, fs, etc.).

This file has ZERO imports — it is the ultimate dependency leaf. Every
module that needs a kind constant imports it from here.

Kind ranges:
    1  –  16 : console.*
   17  –  22 : global numeric / string utilities
   23  –  25 : String / Boolean / Object / Array constructors
   26  –  31 : eval / queueMicrotask / URI functions
   32  –  36, 420 : Error family constructors
   37  –  44 : Object / Array static methods
   45  –  49 : Function.prototype methods, Function constructor
   50  –  80 : String prototype / static methods
   81  –  93 : Number / Boolean prototype methods
   94  –  99 : Object.prototype / Error.prototype methods
  100 – 101 : JSON static methods
  102 – 107 : Symbol / iterator
  108 – 137 : Map / Set / WeakMap / WeakSet
  138 – 174 : Array prototype methods
  175 – 179 : Generator
  200 – 239 : Date
  240 – 249 : Promise
  260 – 266 : Timers
  270       : process.nextTick
  280 – 284 : Process
  290 – 298, 360 – 376 : File System / Streams
  300 – 309 : Streams
  380 – 387 : Network bridge (TCP / TLS)
  430 – 435 : ArrayBuffer binary bridge (Phase 6.13)
  436 – 441 : Streaming decompression + binary I/O (Phase 6.12)
"""

