# `make check_native_kinds` after adding kinds here.
#
# Merge note: adel_fixes duplicated seal/isSealed/isFrozen, the Annex-B
# __lookup*/__define* kinds, MARK_NON_CONSTRUCTOR, BIGINT_VALUEOF/TOLOCALESTRING,
# SYMBOL_VALUEOF, and the Date UTC setters — all already present in HEAD at
# 857-887 with spec-correct handlers. Those duplicates are dropped; only the
# genuinely-new binary-registration and Map/Set size-getter kinds are kept.

# ── Wave 7 — dgram / UDP async bridge ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 945–946 occupied (FS_STATFS=944, PROCESS_GET_ACTIVE_RESOURCES_INFO=946)

# ── Wave 9 — asymmetric key generation (node:crypto KeyObject) ────────────────

